      "form": true,
      "content": "<p><strong>Aanmelden voor een cursus</strong></p><p>U wilt een cursus doen bij het buurthuis. Vul het aanmeldformulier in.</p><p><em>Vul het formulier in.</em></p><p><em>Sommige gegevens mag u zelf verzinnen.</em></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 1rem 0;\"><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Achternaam</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Voornaam</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Geboortedatum</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Adres</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Postcode en woonplaats</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Telefoonnummer</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">E-mailadres</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Welke cursus</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa; vertical-align: top;\">Waarom wilt u deze cursus doen?</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.75rem; vertical-align: top; height: 80px;\"></td></tr></table>",
